# Known Issues

Version context: v0.5.0

## Active

1. Cross-server ownership leakage
- Per-server ownership schema exists in data/season1-servers.json.
- Runtime territory editing mutates shared season1-map tile ownerId.
- Ownership changes made in one server workspace appear in other server workspaces.

2. Dashboard summaries are placeholders
- Command Centre cards render static placeholder values.
- Real scoring and computed strategic summaries are not yet integrated.

3. Summary service is inactive
- src/services/summary-service.js exists.
- It is not loaded by index.html and not wired into runtime UI.

## Not Yet Implemented

- Persistence/save
- Real scoring rules pipeline
- History playback
- Notes workflows
- Objectives workflows
- Search and filters
